content:
Help me define bounded contexts. Below I will provide domain information. 

#### Data:
These are the extracted objects and the subdomain grouping:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Student",
      "description": "An enrolled learner participating in courses and exams.",
      "attributes": [
        "Enrollment Record",
        "Financial Record"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Enrollment Record",
      "description": "Official record of a student’s registration and academic details."
    },
    {
      "name": "Financial Record",
      "description": "Record of all tuition payments and outstanding balances for a student."
    },
    {
      "name": "Application Form",
      "description": "Form submitted by an applicant to apply for admission.",
      "attributes": [
        "Required Documents"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Required Documents",
      "description": "Supporting documents such as transcripts or certificates for admission."
    },
    {
      "name": "Registrar",
      "description": "University staff member managing applications, enrollments, and course schedules."
    },
    {
      "name": "Admission Committee",
      "description": "Group responsible for deciding which applicants are accepted."
    },
    {
      "name": "Lecturer",
      "description": "Faculty member responsible for teaching courses and evaluating students.",
      "attributes": [
        "Course"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Course",
      "description": "A subject offered by the university.",
      "attributes": [
        "Syllabus",
        "Class"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Syllabus",
      "description": "Outline of topics, objectives, and requirements for a course."
    },
    {
      "name": "Class",
      "description": "Scheduled teaching session within a course.",
      "attributes": [
        "Attendance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Attendance",
      "description": "Record of student participation in class sessions."
    },
    {
      "name": "Assignment",
      "description": "Task given to students for assessment purposes."
    },
    {
      "name": "Exam",
      "description": "Formal test evaluating student performance."
    },
    {
      "name": "Tuition Fee",
      "description": "Payment required from students to attend courses."
    },
    {
      "name": "Accountant",
      "description": "Staff member managing tuition payments and financial records."
    },
    {
      "name": "Payment Reminder",
      "description": "Notice sent to students about unpaid fees."
    }
  ]
}
```
```json
{
  "subdomains": {
    "Grading": {
      "objects": [
        "Lecturer",
        "Assignment",
        "Exam"
      ]
    },
    "Admission": {
      "objects": [
        "Student",
